  contactDamage: 1
  description: 'A jailer whose lantern holds the green soul-fire of the last escape
    attempt. Wardens learned the oldest lesson of walls: fire them.'
  tactics: 'The escort gun: slow, always behind a Bulwark or Aegis in the same lane,
    firing red homing bolts that curve around its shield. You cannot hit it until
    the wall dies - so either break the wall fast or dodge the bolts and starve it
    of a target. Red bullets hunt; keep moving perpendicular.'
